{
    "_id": "delta-t",
    "name": "Delta T",
    "instructions": "1. Add all ingredients except ginger beer to a shaking tin.\n2. Add ice and shake until chilled.\n3. Strain into a highball glass over an ice spear.\n4. Top with ginger beer.\n5. Add several dashes of Angostura bitters on top.",
    "created_at": null,
